<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 16:03:46 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>布蕾内·布朗表示，人工智能生存的关键是拒绝杰克·韦尔奇的建议并拥抱人性。问题是人类“无法忍受彼此”</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/what-is-brene-brown-key-advice-to-survive-ai-reject-jack-welch-humans-cant-stand-each-other-fortune-mpw-conference/</link><description>布朗说，将我们的人性视为一种责任可能意味着忽视我们最伟大的超级大国。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/54855081740_f1150295b5_o.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 15:32:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/what-is-brene-brown-key-advice-to-survive-ai-reject-jack-welch-humans-cant-stand-each-other-fortune-mpw-conference/</guid></item><item><title>美联储前麦肯锡首席财务官汤姆·巴尔金表示，“人工智能末日”尚未到来</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/feds-tom-barkin-former-mckinsey-cfo-says-ai-apocalypse-hasnt-arrived/</link><description>里士满联储主席表示，企业正在大力投资人工智能以提高生产率，但强劲的盈利使他们无法大幅裁员。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Tom-Barkin.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 13:05:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/feds-tom-barkin-former-mckinsey-cfo-says-ai-apocalypse-hasnt-arrived/</guid></item><item><title>仅 7 月份，特朗普就进行了 1,100 多笔交易，几乎是财政部长斯科特·贝森特去年全年交易总额的 40 倍</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/donald-trump-july-stock-trades-scott-bessent-2025-financial-disclosure-oge-conflict-of-interest-stop-insider-trading-act/</link><description>Trump 的账户 7 月份记录了 1,156 笔交易，而 Bessent 2025 年仅披露了 29 笔交易。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2271127364-e1790288673413.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 07:05:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/donald-trump-july-stock-trades-scott-bessent-2025-financial-disclosure-oge-conflict-of-interest-stop-insider-trading-act/</guid></item><item><title>安德鲁·科莫：美国不能在金融的未来上落后</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/andrew-cuomo-digital-assets-regulation-future-of-finance/</link><description>美国仍然缺乏管理数字资产经济的全面、持久的法律框架。是时候改正了。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Gov-Andrew-Cuomo-Headshot.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 15:21:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/andrew-cuomo-digital-assets-regulation-future-of-finance/</guid></item><item><title>彼得·泰尔表示，德国存在“害怕成功”的问题，这解释了为什么企业家无法像埃隆·马斯克或马克·扎克伯格那样扩大规模</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/billionaire-peter-thiel-germany-fear-of-success-failure-to-scale-global-companies-build-wealth-like-musk-zuckerberg/</link><description>这位 PayPal 和 Palantir 联合创始人的亿万富翁警告说，德国企业家往往回避将公司规模扩大为全球巨头。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2296273783-e1790348197729.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 15:10:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/billionaire-peter-thiel-germany-fear-of-success-failure-to-scale-global-companies-build-wealth-like-musk-zuckerberg/</guid></item><item><title>尽管面临入门级工作末日，但 Z 世代中有一半人计划在年底前到其他地方寻找新工作</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/despite-entry-level-job-apocalypse-half-of-gen-z-planning-to-look-for-new-work-before-end-of-2026/</link><description>大多数 Z 世代都在寻求换工作并获得更高的薪水，尽管机会减少且薪资增长趋于平缓。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2193275251-e1790347730714.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 15:06:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/despite-entry-level-job-apocalypse-half-of-gen-z-planning-to-look-for-new-work-before-end-of-2026/</guid></item><item><title>MSCI 首席执行官：为什么市场必须赶上实际气候风险</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/msci-ceo-why-markets-must-catch-up-with-physical-climate-risk/</link><description>世界各地的气候记录不断下降，现在出现了一个新的重要排放源：人工智能数据中心。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1676991166-e1790081617410.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/msci-ceo-why-markets-must-catch-up-with-physical-climate-risk/</guid></item><item><title>华盛顿仍未通过人工智能安全法。人工智能巨头扩张最快的纽约市正在编写自己的</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/new-york-city-council-speaker-ai-regulation-bills-openai-anthropic/</link><description>显然，我们不会以任何方式扼杀创新。”市议会议长朱莉·梅宁 (Julie Menin) 告诉《财富》杂志。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1255217585-e1790279472228.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/new-york-city-council-speaker-ai-regulation-bills-openai-anthropic/</guid></item><item><title>入门级工作其实一直都是秘密学徒，AI只是削减了补贴</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/ai-junior-jobs-apprenticeship-talent-pipeline/</link><description>沃顿商学院教授帕特里克·哈克（Patrick Harker）担任费城联邦储备银行行长已有十年。他知道劳动力市场紧张是什么样子。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1482072426.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 14:05:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/ai-junior-jobs-apprenticeship-talent-pipeline/</guid></item><item><title>联邦网络机构公布了还有 40 天的中期计划：“让他们在选举前 5 周内到来，是的，这是很好的努力”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/election-cybersecurity-plan-midterms/</link><description>该计划是在八月中旬的最后期限几周后才出台的，此前各州已经转向私人供应商来取代联邦网络安全支持。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26261579308574-e1790343673619.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 13:57:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/election-cybersecurity-plan-midterms/</guid></item></channel></rss>